{"ref":"character:zephyr","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Zephyr is a secret playable character introduced in the 2025 update of the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Their starting weapon is either the ",{"i":"Sprite-Knife.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:knife"}," ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Curved_Knife.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"weapon:curved-knife"}," ",{"t":"Curved Knife","r":"weapon:curved-knife"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["28 October 2025 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_ZEPHYR"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Zephyr_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Knife.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:knife"}," ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Defeat the Chronomage with Dracula's Reincarnation after the clock strikes 30."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Daniele_Zandara.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Out Of Time - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Amount","cells":[["+2"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Defeat the Chronomage with Dracula's Reincarnation after the clock strikes 30.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After unlocking the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pile_of_Secrets.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"}," ",{"t":"Pile of Secrets","r":"relic:pile-of-secrets"},", the player must pass 30:00 on ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," as ",{"i":"Sprite-Soma_Cruz.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:soma-cruz"}," ",{"t":"Soma Cruz","r":"character:soma-cruz"},". After reaching this point, the player must then defeat ",{"i":"Sprite-Zephyr_(enemy).png","w":24,"h":24}," Zephyr, located at the bottom of the clock tower on the right side of the same stage. Doing so will unlock Zephyr as a playable character. It is recommended to attempt this with ",{"i":"Sprite-Seventh_Trumpet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:seventh-trumpet"}," ",{"t":"Endless Mode","r":"relic:seventh-trumpet"}," enabled to avoid having to deal with ",{"i":"Sprite-The_Reaper.png","w":20,"h":24}," The Reaper."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Zephyr can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 5,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Zephyr can be unlocked in the ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"abouttimeyoushowedup\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Zephyr starts with +50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," and +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["While an ",{"i":"Sprite-Orologion.png","w":24,"h":24}," Orologion is in effect, he gains an additional +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," and -33% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},". Orologions are also twice as common."]},{"k":"p","c":["Zephyr is adept with ",{"i":"Sprite-Knife.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:knife"}," ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Curved_Knife.png","w":19,"h":24,"r":"weapon:curved-knife"}," ",{"t":"Curved Knife","r":"weapon:curved-knife"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Pocket_Knife.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:pocket-knife"}," ",{"t":"Pocket Knife","r":"weapon:pocket-knife"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},", their evolutions, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Million_Cut.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:million-cut"}," ",{"t":"Million Cut","r":"weapon:million-cut"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Since the boost to Cooldown and Move Speed only applies while the Orologion time stop is in effect, ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," is not a key Arcana for Zephyr despite generating more Orologions as the benefit from it is too situational. Instead, it is usually preferable to run a ",{"i":"Sprite-Slash_(XVI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:slash-xvi"}," ",{"t":"Slash (XVI)","r":"arcana:slash-xvi"}," build backed by ",{"i":"Sprite-Claimh_Solais.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:claimh-solais"}," ",{"t":"Claimh Solais","r":"weapon:claimh-solais"}," and possibly ",{"i":"Sprite-Iron_Blue_Will_(VII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:iron-blue-will-vii"}," ",{"t":"Iron Blue Will (VII)","r":"arcana:iron-blue-will-vii"}," depending on selected weapons."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["However, it can be useful to make room for ",{"i":"Sprite-Greatest_Jubilee.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:greatest-jubilee"}," ",{"t":"Greatest Jubilee","r":"weapon:greatest-jubilee"}," in Zephyr's loadout, as it benefits from Slash and may generate more Orologions."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hail_from_the_Future_(X).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"}," ",{"t":"Hail from the Future (X)","r":"arcana:hail-from-the-future-x"}," is also a generically powerful Arcana that can help, among other things, generate additional Orologions."]}]}},{"c":["Knife is typically preferable over Curved Knife as the latter does not benefit from Slash and the former can be evolved into the very powerful ",{"i":"Sprite-Million_Cut.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:million-cut"}," ",{"t":"Million Cut","r":"weapon:million-cut"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Zephyr.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Zephyr's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Zephyr.gif","w":108,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 28 May 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Edge of the Earth's movement speed modifier not applying to Chula-Reh, Brad Fang, or Zephyr"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Infinite loading screen occurs if Zephyr was selected in online lobby"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 28 October 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Zephyr","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Zephyr"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"PowerUp-Growth.png","w":40,"h":40}]},{"k":"p","c":["Stub"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article is a stub. You can help Vampire Survivors Wiki by ",{"t":"expanding it","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Zephyr?action=edit"},"."]}],"subs":[]}]}